它都重新裝潢的今天才來完成當年錯過的美味。第一次吃，本來預期要點招牌魚介豚骨，結果看到最濃煮干，就給他點下去了，個人真的很愛尼波西，然後又看到最濃，真的是要來吃吃看，吃完的感想是真的很美味，把煮干煮成濃厚湯頭，煮到都像泡系了，但完全沒有像豚骨那種油膩感，也沒有過鹹，那個濃厚鮮味跟香氣完全在嘴裡繚繞，對於魚介愛好者來說真的是必點~",null,[0,233]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11576539548184271884/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMmt3ZEZsVVVsUlBTRlpEV2xWT2RWbFVVbmRpTURGVVkwVkdlRmRzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11576539548184271884/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMmt3ZEZsVVVsUlBTRlpEV2xWT2RWbFVVbmRpTURGVVkwVkdlRmRzUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11576539548184271884/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMmt3ZEZsVVVsUlBTRlpEV2xWT2RWbFVVbmRpTURGVVkwVkdlRmRzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11576539548184271884/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMmt3ZEZsVVVsUlBTRlpEV2xWT2RWbFVVbmRpTURGVVkwVkdlRmRzUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11576539548184271884/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMmt3ZEZsVVVsUlBTRlpEV2xWT2RWbFVVbmRpTURGVVkwVkdlRmRzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11576539548184271884/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMmt3ZEZsVVVsUlBTRlpEV2xWT2RWbFVVbmRpTURGVVkwVkdlRmRzUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,22191,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kwdFlUUlRPSFZDWlVOdVlUUndiMDFUY0VGeFdsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1c5b1c90785e9e10!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOi0tYTRTOHVCZUNuYTRwb01TcEFxWlE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kwdFlUUlRPSFZDWlVOdVlUUndiMDFUY0VGeFdsRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kwdFlUUlRPSFZDWlVOdVlUUndiMDFUY0VGeFdsRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kwdFlUUlRPSFZDWlVOdVlUUndiMDFUY0VGeFdsRRILMGRZb05PNkxqdEoaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09pMHRZVFJUT0hWQ1pVTnVZVFJ3YjAxVGNF